{"3918850": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Might & Magic Fates - Heroes TCG", "steam_appid": 3918850, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>AN ORIGINAL MIGHT &amp; MAGIC STRATEGY CARD GAME!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Might &amp; Magic Fates TCG is an original strategy card game rooted in the legendary Might &amp; Magic universe. Build your deck, summon mythical creatures, cast devastating spells, and lead iconic heroes into battle. Each card is part of a living legacy shaped by decades of fantasy lore and player imagination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918850/extras/67a4f0bdd6a7abf0098cf46d37ae332e.poster.avif?t=1781624086\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918850/extras/67a4f0bdd6a7abf0098cf46d37ae332e.webm?t=1781624086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918850/extras/67a4f0bdd6a7abf0098cf46d37ae332e.mp4?t=1781624086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE THE SEA OF FATES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fractured multiverse where timelines collide and destinies unravel. Lead the charge with powerful heroes, command diverse armies, and outwit your opponents in tactical duels that reward creativity and skill. Whether you're a longtime fan or new to card games, Fates offers a fresh take on a legendary world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918850/extras/ad2b29c2f66f1d6e8bdb114d753ee1ce.poster.avif?t=1781624086\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918850/extras/ad2b29c2f66f1d6e8bdb114d753ee1ce.webm?t=1781624086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918850/extras/ad2b29c2f66f1d6e8bdb114d753ee1ce.mp4?t=1781624086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COMMAND MIGHT &amp; MAGIC HEROES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead with iconic heroes drawn from the Might &amp; Magic universe. Progress each hero like an RPG character, unlocking game-changing abilities and evolving your strategy over time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918850/extras/512e15f811a7f735dd0cb22b9bf1eee3.poster.avif?t=1781624086\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918850/extras/512e15f811a7f735dd0cb22b9bf1eee3.webm?t=1781624086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918850/extras/512e15f811a7f735dd0cb22b9bf1eee3.mp4?t=1781624086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COLLECT HUNDRED OF CARDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your arsenal with powerful spells, creatures, and artifacts — as well as unique hero cards and strategic building cards that shape the battlefield in your favor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918850/extras/d64de314d434a0f470edd883c9479e22.poster.avif?t=1781624086\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918850/extras/d64de314d434a0f470edd883c9479e22.webm?t=1781624086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918850/extras/d64de314d434a0f470edd883c9479e22.mp4?t=1781624086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MASTER ICONIC FACTIONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight for the glory of Haven, raise the dead in Necropolis, unleash Inferno’s fury, or command the arcane power of Academy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLAY WITH STRATEGY AND FREEDOM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft your own tactics with a flexible deckbuilding system, then test your skill in battles where synergy, positioning, and timing matter more than luck.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLAY SOLO OR PVP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb the ranks in competitive multiplayer or enjoy seasonal solo events and faction-based challenges.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FREE TO PLAY, FAIR FOR ALL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play and progress without paywalls. In-game purchases are optional and never required to compete.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your cards are more than tools. They are echoes of fallen worlds, bound to fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you truly prepared to discover your fate?</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>AN ORIGINAL MIGHT &amp; MAGIC STRATEGY CARD GAME!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Might &amp; Magic Fates TCG is an original strategy card game rooted in the legendary Might &amp; Magic universe. Build your deck, summon mythical creatures, cast devastating spells, and lead iconic heroes into battle. Each card is part of a living legacy shaped by decades of fantasy lore and player imagination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918850/extras/67a4f0bdd6a7abf0098cf46d37ae332e.poster.avif?t=1781624086\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918850/extras/67a4f0bdd6a7abf0098cf46d37ae332e.webm?t=1781624086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918850/extras/67a4f0bdd6a7abf0098cf46d37ae332e.mp4?t=1781624086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE THE SEA OF FATES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fractured multiverse where timelines collide and destinies unravel. Lead the charge with powerful heroes, command diverse armies, and outwit your opponents in tactical duels that reward creativity and skill. Whether you're a longtime fan or new to card games, Fates offers a fresh take on a legendary world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918850/extras/ad2b29c2f66f1d6e8bdb114d753ee1ce.poster.avif?t=1781624086\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918850/extras/ad2b29c2f66f1d6e8bdb114d753ee1ce.webm?t=1781624086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918850/extras/ad2b29c2f66f1d6e8bdb114d753ee1ce.mp4?t=1781624086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COMMAND MIGHT &amp; MAGIC HEROES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead with iconic heroes drawn from the Might &amp; Magic universe. Progress each hero like an RPG character, unlocking game-changing abilities and evolving your strategy over time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918850/extras/512e15f811a7f735dd0cb22b9bf1eee3.poster.avif?t=1781624086\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918850/extras/512e15f811a7f735dd0cb22b9bf1eee3.webm?t=1781624086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918850/extras/512e15f811a7f735dd0cb22b9bf1eee3.mp4?t=1781624086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COLLECT HUNDRED OF CARDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your arsenal with powerful spells, creatures, and artifacts — as well as unique hero cards and strategic building cards that shape the battlefield in your favor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918850/extras/d64de314d434a0f470edd883c9479e22.poster.avif?t=1781624086\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918850/extras/d64de314d434a0f470edd883c9479e22.webm?t=1781624086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918850/extras/d64de314d434a0f470edd883c9479e22.mp4?t=1781624086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MASTER ICONIC FACTIONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight for the glory of Haven, raise the dead in Necropolis, unleash Inferno’s fury, or command the arcane power of Academy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLAY WITH STRATEGY AND FREEDOM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft your own tactics with a flexible deckbuilding system, then test your skill in battles where synergy, positioning, and timing matter more than luck.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLAY SOLO OR PVP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb the ranks in competitive multiplayer or enjoy seasonal solo events and faction-based challenges.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FREE TO PLAY, FAIR FOR ALL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play and progress without paywalls. In-game purchases are optional and never required to compete.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your cards are more than tools. They are echoes of fallen worlds, bound to fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you truly prepared to discover your fate?</strong></p>", "short_description": "Might &amp; Magic Fates TCG is an original card battle game where you command Heroes, summon iconic creatures, cast devastating spells, and build tactical structures. Collect tons of cards, build unique decks and crush rivals in epic duels to become a legend of the Sea of Fates.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Thai, Traditional Chinese, Turkish, Polish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918850/25eb97ef009478f957b32c8d727f6fc5d24bcbb9/header.jpg?t=1781624086", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918850/8b460e7c17a1e73cf3c6f5410b0b426a21d7cd77/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781624086", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918850/8b460e7c17a1e73cf3c6f5410b0b426a21d7cd77/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781624086", "website": "https://mightandmagicfates.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows® 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel® Core™ 2 Duo (2.2 GHz)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 3 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA® GeForce® 8600 GT or ATI™ Radeon™ HD 2600XT or better<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet 